---
# ext-scarpe, ledger N1: Scarpe draws its own controls, so it tells a screen reader what they are.
testability: interactive
display: native
ledger: N1
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  @said = para "nothing"
  @name = edit_line("Nick") { |line| @said.replace "saw #{line.text}" }
end
----------- test code
a11y_action edit_line("@name"), :set_value, "Noah"
assert_equal "Noah", edit_line("@name").text
assert_equal "saw Noah", para("@said").text, "one change, with the whole new text"
